[I] World's fastest and most advanced password recovery utility

[T] hashcat is the world's fastest and most advanced password recovery utility,
[T] supporting five unique modes of attack for over 300 highly-optimized hashing
[T] algorithms. hashcat currently supports CPUs, GPUs, and other hardware
[T] accelerators on Linux, Windows, and macOS, and has facilities to help
[T] enable distributed password cracking.

[U] https://hashcat.net/hashcat/

